# backend/Dockerfile only ever COPYs backend/, pyproject.toml, uv.lock,
# pytest.ini, main.py, and builds its own .venv in-container via uv sync -
# none of the below is ever read by that build, just uploaded to the builder
# on every deploy. NOTE: artifacts/ must stay OUT of this list - unlike
# backend/Dockerfile, artifacts/frontend/Dockerfile's build stage does
# `COPY . .` and needs the whole pnpm workspace (root package.json,
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, artifacts/frontend itself, and the lib/* packages it
# depends on) plus explicitly COPYs artifacts/frontend/nginx.conf in its
# final stage - excluding artifacts/ breaks that build entirely.
.venv
attached_assets
temp
markdown

# Replit-platform deployment metadata - irrelevant to any Docker build here,
# and on Windows this project's OneDrive-synced checkout has repeatedly hit
# transient file-transfer errors on these specific files during `docker build`.
**/.replit-artifact
